{"step_index":83,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-24T22:58:15Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"search_web","args":{"query":"\"\\\"GTA 6\\\" OR \\\"GTA VI\\\" all missions list OR \\\"mission order\\\" OR \\\"mission flow\\\"\"","toolAction":"\"Searching GTA 6 full mission list and flow\"","toolSummary":"\"Search GTA 6 mission order and flow\""}}]}
{"step_index":84,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-24T22:58:18Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-24T17:58:18-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-24T17:58:22-05:00\nThe search for \"\"GTA 6\" OR \"GTA VI\" all missions list OR \"mission order\" OR \"mission flow\"\" returned the following summary:\nThe campaign structure of ***Grand Theft Auto VI*** spans **91 mandatory main story missions** (plus an opening Prologue), organized across **five distinct chapters**[1]. The game scales significantly in length compared to *GTA V* (closer to the scope of *Red Dead Redemption 2*), taking players from the Leonida Keys up through Port Gellhorn and into Vice City[1][2].\n\n---\n\n### **Important Mission Structure Changes**\n* **No Gold Medals:** Rockstar has dropped the traditional performance-tracking system (time limits, accuracy quotas) seen in *GTA V* and *RDR2*[1].\n* **No Mission Replay:** Unlike previous titles, you **cannot replay completed missions** from a menu. If you want to experience a specific heist or mission again, you must rely on manual save files[1].\n* **Character Switching:** Early chapters focus primarily on individual protagonists (Jason or Lucia), but character-switching opens up dynamically during Chapter 2[1].\n\n---\n\n### **Mission Flow & Chapter Breakdown**\n\n#### **Prologue**\n* *Focus:* Introduction to Lucia and the baseline setup[3][4].\n* **Missions included:** \n  1. *Prologue* (Lucia and her prison counselor)[3][4]\n\n#### **Chapter 1: Just Like Paradise**\n* *Location:* Leonida Keys / Hamlet Prison / Early smuggling circuits[3][5]\n* *Overview:* Focuses heavily on Jason, introducing local contacts, odd jobs, and petty smuggling before the narrative scales up[3].\n* **Selected Mission Flow:**\n  * *Gone Fishing*[3]\n  * *Gear Up*[3]\n  * *Just A Scratch*[3]\n  * *Lab Fees*[3]\n  * *Unwanted Attention*[3]\n  * *Pipework*[3]\n  * *Hey Arnold!*[3]\n  * *Island Dreams*[3]\n  * *Feng Shui*[3]\n  * *Coming Home*[3]\n  * *Buck Me*[3]\n  * *Clean Up After Donnie*[3]\n  * *Down to Earth*[3]\n  * *Clear Skies*[3]\n  * *Day Release*[3]\n  * *Swamped*[3]\n  * *Tourist Trap* / *Home Sweet Home* / *Discharge Time* (Point of no return\n<truncated 583 bytes>\n:* Transitioning toward Vice City outskirts and regional connections[2]\n* *Overview:* Mid-game escalation where smuggling rings turn into high-stakes drug operations, laying the groundwork for the migration into the main city[2].\n\n#### **Chapter 4: Vice City, Baby**\n* *Location:* Vice City proper[2]\n* *Overview:* The largest chunk of the game. Opens up the neon-lit urban core, featuring major setups, elaborate heists, and navigating complex criminal conspiracies[1][2].\n\n#### **Chapter 5: Top of the World, Ma!**\n* *Location:* Vice City / Finale locations[2]\n* *Overview:* The high-stakes culmination of Jason and Lucia's arc, wrapping up loose ends, betrayals, and the ultimate climax of the campaign[1].\n\nSources:\n[1] [clarin.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEHmgE9r0iOxoWNwMymCUZG5BmKRV3NqrJxZE17AwTGvK6LM9YYKKLxU1RJKQZMxVql6XS-X5B02zjcKZiDLRuI8ld8f7lIcVbzXGIw0fOy8lXOCjTyrEK3c8SRp_pMEyywLu5AnQCqeBJlB6mCQIZM6cXjUpDxB1gavp2b7JdI8VGf9dgPQiDGJqLg5Vy6tpOHsHi20q1X9Hz7g8dwhlSGF0fuK7lAzQDPF0k=)\n[2] [gamesradar.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHQtZJWgr3qZGTUTmvL8QyK2GNiBd628lzAfjpbxG4sIMFa1Vo3rcsXiTrjecqDKVT2cxjR5ns2K0RskC6amZjhVCKixVl61rsfuzpr64bwjOo0VwQ-C9SZJRCw4IxU_rgBtL7dFmvNt85igfQgsoDyziKYm0dht6J5PIg=)\n[3] [pcgamer.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFG4TajTAQWNPciItIwc7qZO2Sf7CrnluHJXouBCvQcgQ3Ew1cdT3Y0TIHFF_4DYsaC4QjBoVVHjcFHuuGFkZAVrtntv2ZS1Vt6-qlyJxt0vQAHqM78VrWxRQ2WDjPPMZ93OzIYveCFfdWMis-yX486AZmShm2nsok=)\n[4] [mobalytics.gg](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFvy0ssBkUwzcJq8SHikqc6RYwyot_A90Q5zh_AyYTT-JYao4Tpty2zn4_9cEWopxU-ics_krGCVaaJAN84TfuPO7Re21tdgBuaJ0PTq2Yb4TCsf