{"step_index":88,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-24T22:58:31Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-24T17:58:31-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-24T17:58:34-05:00\nThe search for \"\"GTA 6\" OR \"Grand Theft Auto VI\" \"Chapter 1\" \"Chapter 2\" \"Chapter 3\" \"Chapter 4\" \"Chapter 5\" missions list OR walkthrough\" returned the following summary:\nIn *Grand Theft Auto VI* (*GTA 6*), the story campaign following protagonists Jason and Lucia across the state of Leonida is divided into **5 main chapters**[1] encompassing roughly 90–99 total story missions[2][3]. \n\nThe structural breakdown of the chapters and their respective themes/titles include:\n\n### **Chapter 1: Just Like Paradise**[4]\n* **Focus:** Serves as the extended opening block of the game (featuring around 22–23 missions, including the Prologue)[5][6], introducing players to the mechanics, the regional setting outside the city, and characters like Jason, Lucia, and their early criminal associates as they pull off local smuggling and odd jobs[5][7].\n* **Notable early missions include:** *Prologue*, *Gone Fishing*, *Gear Up*, *Just A Scratch*, *Lab Fees*, *Unwanted Attention*, and *Buck Me*[5][7].\n\n### **Chapter 2: Paradise Lost**[4]\n* **Focus:** Consists of roughly 11 missions[6]. Escalates the friction in Jason and Lucia's criminal operations, forcing them to adapt as regional law enforcement and rival elements close in, pushing them deeper into the underbelly of Leonida.\n\n### **Chapter 3: Tits Ass Drug Money**[4]\n* **Focus:** One of the larger blocks in the game with around 26 missions[6]. This chapter ramps up the scale of smuggling, larger heists, and high-stakes operations as the protagonists expand their influence and network across different territories.\n\n### **Chapter 4: Vice City, Baby**[4]\n* **Focus:** Comprising about 25 missions[6], this chapter shifts the core of the narrative directly into the neon-lit urban sprawl of Vice City[8]. Operations become more organized, moving toward major corporate targets, high-end scores, and complex webbed connections.\n\n### **Chapter 5: Top of the World, Ma**[4]\n* **Focus:** The finale chapter (around 7 m\n<truncated 438 bytes>\ntDiRcJpccmf7hwTY9-zcEx1Ou5RbG-S_NM38K_maSIRTRzInjiACtEyz6GG6woxXxcbDTIz2NJ8EiPilaS44ohyuu7zJIEw=)\n[2] [redbull.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEndglJlNICVVQJ8UcMa0P84MOGpTIjjwHBmHpliIW5YyVrqOIQeQKXNo6vn41pgzbDoCgwVVQUDbCkN9TvjzFMXc6CBpKbGsZJIykN4AWbf0zMTz8eN7ubHZmmOOhk_hE3EdLGv0WaZXHDKyKxz60=)\n[3] [rockpapershotgun.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHQ9B0TzsANroiC_oZ6GgUj240i9xCsDDqusagEr9I6EDxYFnF8x9qP5Kyfi3FoYSt_0bnNN3k_By5V4FD85YJMkVw79Al8O333HjIeTLk6-OQkS5rmdT6Stz1UTWmIOpbKDWW-SMqS2VBtSOHc-7gi7ISq)\n[4] [pcgamer.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEOTAx-Jn5LGpohom3nJhRQkk4siqRBG6RzfxpWxsgBEuxISA6demudtT1zOw8mdMjllK84wmsIbfHSC82NZZjn8xWTbBjvwRrgwL9PBfEcJGt1irUh1WkLVv9W4Jo2sScHOeOehHsLHwshNgvQ_DZ9xrEYUSJ3Ot8=)\n[5] [ign.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF4-iWy1R6zmbNXXGLW3G4NP7jhWtRyNWrT1ghoI6zjz6jF72ljyvEJJz0u9pITev9Pus4oynz62qGgGsEftW9X7f_RlZlxOjp9i8w3IQzrgHPHz6S5I0dKOsS7pQiY6nBd)\n[6] [thebiglead.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHoDsj0Z609F58M65vd1Ibbn526zfzCwj04EONimSHGhbf5WrLe7OrX8GFWcIt_W25CAaQiXUvRJyfrD9lA7-nVpL7Lry2u-FujU_nSyLcJrUHcHbBYOpAqW4Gztbina7MNdmwpBnnlsFCpb96WPLjqog==)\n[7] [pcgamer.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEOTAx-Jn5LGpohom3nJhRQkk4siqRBG6RzfxpWxsgBEuxISA6demudtT1zOw8mdMjllK84wmsIbfHSC82NZZjn8xWTbBjvwRrgwL9PBfEcJGt1irUh1WkLVv9W4Jo2sScHOeOehHsLHwshNgvQ_DZ9xrEYUSJ3Ot8=)\n[8] [gamesradar.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF7sSVEZWZGJnduuBTzDklElSgRFVgrmVXhxF46zpsgW7JQdG9p6BmiGN7xt-U52UvSl8T6AzsXCuGBGlmWV3aKv8dTY0L3CU8XN-hy_7AMvrSPQwsDS5HIWA3aZJhSaubaf