{"step_index":94,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-24T22:58:50Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-24T17:58:50-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-24T17:58:54-05:00\nThe search for \"\"Operation Savage Glory\" \"Protective Custody\" \"Top of the World, Ma!\" GTA 6 final mission\" returned the following summary:\nThese terms are all tied to the final stretch and endgame of **Grand Theft Auto VI** (Chapter 5)[1][2]. \n\nHere is how they connect to the climax of the game:\n\n* **\"Top of the World, Ma!\"**: This is the title of **Chapter 5** of the GTA 6 campaign, which takes place in Vice City and acts as the final narrative arc closing out Jason and Lucia's story[2][3]. \n* **\"Operation Savage Glory\"**: This is a major, roughly 50-minute multi-tiered tactical mission late in Chapter 5 (following missions like *Doggie Bag* and *VC Baby*)[4][1]. In it, Jason and Lucia work with Giorgio Gallo’s crew to raid a coast guard base, blow up bridge pillars, and recover a seized shipment[4]. Successfully completing it clears their immediate Leonida heat and rewards you with the *Snow Storm* achievement/trophy, setting up the final sequence of events[4][1].\n* **\"Protective Custody\"**: This serves as the true point-of-return endgame trigger mission in Chapter 5[1][5]. After meeting with their lawyer Abe to finalize a pardon/deal, Giorgio betrays them, leading to separate ambushes, corrupt cops, a precinct shootout, and a critical confrontation with Méndez's task force[5][6]. \n  * *Note:* Entering Abe's office prompts a binary choice to **\"Proceed\"** or **\"Postpone\"**[7]. Choosing *Proceed* locks you into a nearly hour-long back-to-back finale sequence (*The End of the Road*) where free-roam is temporarily disabled until the credits roll[7][1]. Meeting specific financial prerequisites (such as banking $2 million in Family Savings) before locking into this final mission is tied to unlocking alternative endings[7][8].\n\nSources:\n[1] [retrobroker.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHOEGoFJFPKe-Z1HXUZfy9QwKxXBGF8Y882H7nLuFPktRlk6e6RfUn3tYTnDJIEKKZaM-0N3Aa8jE8oRq9ObtSf909GJJgGH7zhAei2XlaEiWh9lLt6Rx0uyczxaoAmkB2od4ZtEnCdi5CHKshoAJbUrJPwuMaLYg5ZDzYw9TJcL46rNB8TYoW3fgSsfMB6TQhE3g==)\n[2] [redbull.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFaAmnzaW0Dr7-Y__eWFkowyEfVmCmQjqyD9zPXEEso3MHKeQamt2xmxcWyVyiQgHiXtxBycg58QET-M91EFm2EO5XsQKwAixZD4_55jKRThTe24WwNJJgbI9X8PbVceqXiDQBlbtnBtaPZk6yHEBA=)\n[3] [gamesradar.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGFfimGsYcY2aQnOdgfd8ejO6NRVAlscVOqtj0WOWVFSVmL0z9uiYEQ2Qu4E4UUwTYgbAKa9sxHHwEktZ1sf7kLikirtEhMMBZ7rtPnVx1jLFAq5L97_Vw2nywpyxFuz872vIiAun3tx0Ys3MA7C0J7Edg40wS_5bHJoQ==)\n[4] [powerpyx.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFCaHCyexZETTIbckyLCfJUXfry8ZE9gqCS7i6GzleGco4Kg3__iWvEFxqCASXLyuvvqtFOR1iu2vMf3NLZQ4-PtFKvsJ78Qa7SjI72aTDU5lIRZSQ9Lk4VksRl0tEWuScZctq2WMyMLEwAtaR45DFa_DWcZwYgEZs=)\n[5] [powerpyx.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFU_beXK-z2cHQp0u3FtEHx_-L-iyd9XiNctSUNViOHuqajhEcHahMkwiOgmu9kkpabJShbJ-DMXJczqnHl9wsyelfs6A9tn_O0dSyXBkJOgrYzir-_4AOe_HF_Ca0VfHGurQMY-zkrw2bkwOl0tSF9WKu6LA==)\n[6] [escorenews.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFISImY1D2c3zE4XGIP9ErzvdscOnGDm5jKcZWj508Hh4fFuS3x_Az1ObC1bM3_LQrREAbH1M8dzt_DcjNCVLF_tZ57WWt1IfEe54U6yVZG-dNJwA1ujb1wbrhHxt_YZi7otQjItXfFSO9DY53DNBrXGLq-IuEktkVS2cvI1_dHSMzSC6ulv7NoN-QXAwQUj3P3M90wiBBuYM2SkAk92FDBUei0GH4NgUDoi0JLt30NBLKR5cm2VDfFVPg4ECWrNMRchKeO6lny9dXiUcgT)\n[7] [pcgamer.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGyx4DzezfQ35ZKPA8Gkq2VXlQY4GhucFTnko0ce4SVS8a2W30xIequijwV6nE5Qh1Xi8la51AEGX4hEYHfWusevqwxNlJisv4jRsuhUjL1bwSHyL58_O51lOmY9T_wqIWQrRuIrp0hDFGWAVdbnovmc86oOhGDGtxSDZUvdTLpa6ooeUimjRgaBIKkiDAfDuJQIUwE5YaPD991_moG7yeS7Kg=)\n[8] [gtabase.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud