{"step_index":100,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-24T22:59:23Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-24T17:59:23-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-24T17:59:25-05:00\nThe search for \"\"Chapter 5: Top of the World, Ma!\" all 7 missions list GTA 6\" returned the following summary:\nIn *Grand Theft Auto VI*, **Chapter 5: Top of the World, Ma** serves as the game's finale segment[1][2]. Depending on the specific guide breakdown, publications generally list this final narrative stretch as containing **7 main story missions** (with the ultimate ending mission title typically redacted or generalized to avoid heavy spoilers)[1][3][2]:\n\n1. **Bird in the Hand**[2]\n2. **Taking Liberties**[2]\n3. **VC Baby**[2]\n4. **Doggie Bag**[2]\n5. **Operation Savage Glory**[2]\n6. **Protective Custody**[2]\n7. *[Redacted / Final Mission Finale]*[2]\n\nSources:\n[1] [redbull.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFqJN15T9O_CYcOG1VSsE8HRI6Yq6Ok03g3e2k6r72jq98o7PknshiEFO7SqlVzcJlBcsoi-RwdTu2qEvZrp6PmmH80t1ZY8VUI3-G7i8_WFLa_L9cyrTQf1wOCTegp2O-2sjbkrEs9rYxocZPlM6A=)\n[2] [rockpapershotgun.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFlzHiBUW2JlYIGAAXlfZdy9n4HPbLt3ZowDkoz6GRm2y7Tg_5bMXLby5JIBzSUrCBSMwll1MWmZRY9uakoE_2v0_hwK_PR1DhjwZIeVto3zFM1EbLZs57BPsxjycAGmts3zEsqnoZL-KoJVcNcPMoraCGr)\n[3] [skycoach.gg](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHJQqBQxA8N15_P_0xlPTU5Jq5cCrXSfcP652NTLJ1LQlaB_Q4Thza4MRpsOT0htMUo_faI8oZ67_SmBZ8Sxh8Ty0o88rqZRZTp-WrBtX3BtEzjv5AqkwdkXrLVczF6VSNfySOrc5McE0Xcdr_P3pg=)"}
