{"step_index":102,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-24T22:59:28Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-24T17:59:28-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-24T17:59:31-05:00\nThe search for \"\"Protective Custody\" \"The End of the Road\" GTA 6 OR \"Grand Theft Auto VI\"\" returned the following summary:\n**\"Protective Custody\"** and **\"The End of the Road\"** are the final two back-to-back major story missions that comprise the climax and game-ending sequence of **Grand Theft Auto VI (GTA 6)**[1][2]. \n\n### 1. \"Protective Custody\" (Mission #108)\n* **Context:** Triggered during Chapter 5[1][3] right after meeting with Abe Gonzalez (where the game prompts you to choose whether to *Proceed* into the finale or *Postpone* to wrap up open-world tasks)[4]. \n* **Plot:** Giorgio Gallo betrays Jason Duval and Lucia Caminos, resulting in them being separately taken into custody[3]. Statewide prosecutor Danica Howard pressures Lucia, while both protagonists must separately survive ambushes by dirty cops, fend off a NOOSE assault, and take down Méndez's task force in a heavy firefight[3][5].\n* **Key Decision:** At the end of the mission, players face critical choices involving Méndez and whether to take his deal, which directly feeds into how the narrative's branching conclusions play out[6].\n\n### 2. \"The End of the Road\" (Mission #109)\n* **Context:** The ultimate final main mission of GTA 6, which starts immediately following the completion of *Protective Custody*[7]. \n* **Plot:** Jason and Lucia stage a high-stakes final assault on Giorgio Gallo’s penthouse to retrieve a vital hard drive and fight for their freedom[7]. It features aerial turret sections, breaching the penthouse, fighting through waves of security, escaping helicopter pursuits, and heading toward the Keys[7].\n* **The Final Outcomes:** Depending on cumulative gameplay factors—such as Jason and Lucia's relationship status (\"Hot Together\"), accumulated family savings (such as hitting the $2 million mark), criminal profiles, and prompt choices during the finale (like choosing *Swim For It*)—this mission leads to the game's credits and resolves the story into \n<truncated 279 bytes>\njlLuj3WpQ=)\n[2] [clarin.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEKfYiE7K79xogDQj-VqGnDLFofpQs-zB2hpQqSWDYONq60laFr00SdCa_mYHhMu8SjFMuUzFP3J9EEvbiNYgUdPK3fYJN1-9KeKwAyb7tqUEmtLr9nlMcfcxiT7jwwlJBOvAEQgnOAVcvPFxkRK483WbC-0c_unY2bZvVHEaWE6NvKWJeNSZTm64_MWmirU4m2BrLXHzxutmJ8PbupDh9S_0a-T4VkSNrCbKE=)\n[3] [powerpyx.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFCICRfwXF5IdaYcHhAADeZc-FCA9jqPPeIm6jzH3h8YBIz-UtYVhDp_cvFOzQr0z_pco-J5N5THnuUXM_s6kVgLgCI29vBBzUhINnSwamc72RZRND4wvwLeXE1zl0__6KG6FwqXTCXxqm1OTyQGE9SkKZSVg==)\n[4] [pcgamer.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGe_jfa1SexcFPLJobYoSFbVmufQFThC3s7y17A8nDqtGccJnPODUlHABjJG22OOhB75-woiU3hT_7Eu_sgdEFRSh8k19CSo_pDC-ow5dLwW8OCmmAted1WdZI4zxW1DTq-qIKUFHkzjNos72MSp8kOkuXDBCKZUhhP4QE-SYiMHhq_5e6QlJtGtDb3ywFPuWJd21Erxdh4IthAmkJTOHfiEek=)\n[5] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFI_73HOktrAikUbvgyKTB1cKLHjCVgsSI-J8pVE22wnHnHFJvoPwX_gTaecXkC_xfcnOWEucxPqyqIF03ntcIZsu480ETwnjFnzfyQ_5oQxD5kSQN0o4xZkQwtePxi64Cg)\n[6] [gtabase.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEYZB7ysc1PT5VRTLn21uE6qP3L2BeBNIt5q8f8f3ZOEkDYpCxb5gPoZX1SXMJ6BrPvyU4Yvknqt_UNDuu-QCdFGs8Ls_SaxR0Lx2gbzdy93OpGG-7LRxPWaWoYU_qDzldYMJUas3pfhjxBMeZTUoYG)\n[7] [powerpyx.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF7JE53uYSS1VytWVo5wVqZ29JsjU6AtFsGogYJCW7cJOlnLKKbKuTg8JKo5b1lhWxeeYDn7hNDpbn31WqbhV2PvEB6hwVgIJjwn06P9aMWy0V-0VzqrtDCskAaaZXj5HlFHgzCssdxIAF3XoOlZPO1d3_76uo=)\n[8] [beebom.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHwiZteTmoMYgtBGL2ojCS2GatefjKOa4fJQJu71JPuKNLIORrzjeVF4pQ6TnZI2HNLss5-G55cEywNqzCH0MiQRKqqytTEn2vW-sDRZ1R