{"step_index":108,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-24T23:03:19Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-24T18:03:19-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-24T18:03:22-05:00\nThe search for \"\"Sinfrontera National Bank\" \"The Cartel Heist\" setup missions GTA 6\" returned the following summary:\nIn *Grand Theft Auto VI*, **\"The Cartel Heist\"** is the climactic final mission of **Chapter 3**, where Jason and Lucia team up with Raul Bautista to rob the **Sinfrontera National Bank** in Tequesta (Vice City area), which is used by the Colombian cartel *La Polilla Negra* to launder money[1][2][3].\n\nSuccessfully executing a \"perfect run\" and maximizing your payout (up to a $10.5 million take) depends heavily on completing a series of mandatory and optional setup/preparation missions throughout Chapter 3[4][5]. \n\nThe setup and preparation missions required before hitting the Sinfrontera National Bank include:\n\n### 1. Sinfrontera National Bank (Scope Out)\n* **Mission Giver:** Raul Bautista[2]\n* **Objective:** Jason and Lucia, alongside Raul and Andrea, secretly case the bank to inspect security systems, guard patrols, and camera layouts[1][2]. This kicks off the planning phase for the operation.\n\n### 2. Security Expert\n* **Objective:** Track down and retrieve **Nicole Park**, the bank's internal security expert who has the knowledge required to bypass the high-end vault systems[4][1]. Securing her cooperation is crucial for a smoother breach.\n\n### 3. Company Property\n* **Objective:** Meet up with Pete to acquire the heavy-duty explosives and specialized gear needed to breach the bank's secure infrastructure[4][6]. After receiving the gear, you must defend the haul from an ambush by opposing cops/rivals to ensure *All Cargo Protected*[4].\n\n### 4. The Missing Link\n* **Objective:** Hunt down, capture, and interrogate **Monty** to squeeze vital insider intelligence out of him regarding the cartel's bank schedules and operational flaws[4]. Getting *all* information from Monty directly impacts how well you can optimize the heist.\n\n### 5. Safe Word\n* **Objective:** Steal a practice safe and bring it back so that Nicole can train\n<truncated 1103 bytes>\nring the chaotic extraction phase[5].\n\nSources:\n[1] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHeO4eyaOgPTeCYDTaxL8AioI7Q-9f2peRdFuMI9i3yyMPMhROJCXkUB5Xxu4eq4EddJmfrBqhOFLoS4Fr42vuJEETbyYZRZoDAjcrOD6LuHdltTgfOqAG_3YH0e4vo5g==)\n[2] [powerpyx.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGHIFAdUnbvlW38gmXqvljhzc_cRTy_9uQGhdBj4PDLStCDE08Gg3UsLHjhAyUJj0BCiXJCC66GixziReh6zHM2wze6S00DyByIDQqAYwt7umPMo8BuquVWR81E5-mGW7ABbJlJk8pL47hS3TykNvtTQolABsdX4tD7maHmJ4PoSZGkHFc-DBgJsqvjRleb)\n[3] [vice.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEMiAAMkmjRYjL_tInxhVaHa3Q0TUatnkRG0RpoLGc4Ov_Kj6Esz7UNS6miUsF9KYJoJceVCNrIom95RXOohjaPez0K6DDzXzKk6TO_1lqJpk0tsVgq0ucOHUjMCenVHoS22VowAO-H95UkNiOFy6yPIMhp6BWZJnCuIIRk5_UsYA==)\n[4] [ign.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF1excgRLLkkDN7rBE1FQHsRp8e0tVjXbWp-1jBIRrVeukIYPfs1kX5mufs7LDNhZDnReNpsEHEovSyVJ0isMfkPBFqha1ARc8UGCw2mS8NAHZ_OyIwnadyuW3V17TvkiPlJOjAJQDBgdZBWMCOj0nIVP4=)\n[5] [reddit.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFH1p9kc1HHuZgcerwV8-URWoPb5FLnJPWfpEVON6nWN2m_n88tYsdw3oKLjce_2jIQV3JDEUbmqP0HU8UaI2uYc7lEQeeBS8TOpT2JONbF7i5cYSUoK0mqdrvRSRgbV-88b3zdlGN_Fdo0Mb2O9_62EPrHGzYAwXWzg78VY8V8l7_T4sVqQgiT-a1luT67Kx6sBT7VPuk1)\n[6] [ign.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEUGL2wE90Uoyj9wmVeyZGfdmTMdgfYVnyYIn23ZNovr6kNvLGoD5ahBX7QxWLuYq8S52rASIeQwxjNuCPEMknFhNxccEezd9p1ojsJy3N0W_XQpId8-cpayjmGc5l5PB8vCoHKdHXyeqzR4FR84ArIWjs=)\n[7] [gtabase.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEUrHHjNqLZJ6SORzvYNd_-HIZA6NV24tQbMEjNpCkQhAXf1dz7eQcrwF-_6_jK3XpL8IqvL8HffKGI_HOYr-1Si-wcxrTkspPMiZC3mcum9