{"step_index":110,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-24T23:03:25Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-24T18:03:25-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-24T18:03:28-05:00\nThe search for \"\"VCIA Takedown\" setup missions GTA 6 OR \"Chapter 4\" prerequisites\" returned the following summary:\nIn **Grand Theft Auto VI**, **\"VCIA Takedown\"** is the major multi-stage airport heist culminating Chapter 4 of the story (taking place around the Vice City International Airport)[1][2]. \n\nTo unlock and successfully trigger the **VCIA Takedown** setup missions and fulfill the **Chapter 4 prerequisites**, you need to work through a specific sequence of events:\n\n### 1. Chapter 4 Progress & Prerequisites\nVCIA Takedown is not available right at the start of Chapter 4 (\"Vice City, Baby\"). You must first establish operations at the Y Hotel in Ocean Beach/Vice Beach[3][2] and progress through the earlier narrative arc of the chapter. \n\n* **The Cash Requirement:** Partway through Chapter 4 (following missions like *Party Hard*), you will be required to raise and send $75,000 to Abe Gonzalez via BuckMe to keep the story moving[1].\n* **Prerequisite Quests:** You must clear the preceding narrative string involving Dre’Quan (culminating in his quest **\"Headliners\"**) as well as standard introductory Ocean Beach operations[4][3].\n\n### 2. VCIA Takedown Setup Missions\nLike other massive heists in the game, the VCIA Takedown requires several preparation and intelligence-gathering tasks before the actual job can go live[5]:\n* **Preparation Quests:** You will undertake various undercover tasks, security jobs, and equipment acquisitions assigned by characters like Raul[4] and Kordell[6].\n* **\"Fully Catered\":** This is one of the mandatory preparation/setup tasks tied directly into readying the operation[7]. \n* **Starting Location:** Once all preparation quests and prerequisite character missions (like Headliners) are cleared, the mission officially triggers out of the **Stockyard** area in Vice City[4].\n\n### Quick Tips for VCIA Takedown:\n* **Missable Weapon:** During the final ground shootout of the heist (when you switch back to Jason to d\n<truncated 440 bytes>\n the final chapter transition[8].\n\nSources:\n[1] [vice.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEZ4dq2AGtFYDSYArYG69f3QIIqIbMh55sOOBMfAxTfvHmX-oT_d8VRlymai1cn2F0dof3EwB5KxwSbqaMcbwe0jElA3l3a5jvtfdtrPhV5lFVRWQha2yRbmob8Qzqlpyy5Y2x60mI-3o1Ta_k8XDuDZtJl8aYt-csU4hN-9XF2iw==)\n[2] [vice.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEZ4dq2AGtFYDSYArYG69f3QIIqIbMh55sOOBMfAxTfvHmX-oT_d8VRlymai1cn2F0dof3EwB5KxwSbqaMcbwe0jElA3l3a5jvtfdtrPhV5lFVRWQha2yRbmob8Qzqlpyy5Y2x60mI-3o1Ta_k8XDuDZtJl8aYt-csU4hN-9XF2iw==)\n[3] [redbull.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGJ64MJfgKw7AQ7FruDb7JyRT6a-JaWZ6f1jBZ82GE2MfyCICiQvFw4CM-MVOPJ-7x7p_cxXv2lut7oE-dsFptHL6ynOVcaKGGApEFKq-EUo8dg18C6cV0UNfiJonS7rW3hqoT7m2jiiKiMjr8Dyps=)\n[4] [powerpyx.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFyo1pWKsu3nfKG8g8bTpODhaBv_Idmp5_StW5wbou9jg13Fpmz42ad8Ncho92gyJN_YqytuJEaVzpfm4IIeQzVkkKgprgqEhYw0Cz8IE1HT1T5NEvCVEbbjz2XEauMba5hdugOBX2X74bKSAeR7Mg=)\n[5] [skycoach.gg](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEZv2JYy5mu0joxrMo42lT31ApMNv2ogLBGt6-NpTFEOGYKytM3SZT3CpI0GEFaFtykdRgKJPWTImfolxTXtwIaFwL2To0XVhloEfNHwHybIAzdAqp7ZIajsKBbbcRPeFj7Y7wJhU_TGNhxA4efKyY=)\n[6] [sportskeeda.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFtqpi-EaBdJAS-zbA5tOnaKjQlIML8KBe3HWuAQdz88TsJ5fZBRff_0hsZh2kq84wmT5dqWr9_88cowf8itwljk38oajWNW0iBoHQ-sGL9MhTOmm19hhTEmoqEsapD3cyEk4M2XUS5dPQrQjhTAv6PUjUWOcKZ4d2M4OAOyfvmFNBDkQ==)\n[7] [promptowy.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH1dZogD6Uk89ZKku-dXCpn6G_AxMwEAsB5vJ7RRKrAd5aMFB-w_fbgW6tbm2QhFt4zzxDSc22whiCP9FyTWJUNR8IUu8Rev7TRq8KGQlwIK2L0y24bTkqGcjaBr6PZlYl