{"step_index":113,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-24T23:04:05Z","content":"The mission dependency graphs, prerequisite chains, and flowcharts for all five story chapters have been compiled into the artifact below:\n\n📁 **[gta6_mission_flow_chart.md](file:///C:/Users/<user>/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/96252013-4633-45e8-b6a2-59b18be9e68c/gta6_mission_flow_chart.md)**\n\n### Critical Flow Anchors & Bottlenecks Highlighted\n\n1. **Dual Character Switching Unlock**:\n   - Locked to solo characters until completing **\"Coffee Break\"** in Chapter 2, which unlocks dynamic D-pad character switching in the open world.\n2. **Vehicle Fencing System**:\n   - Fencing and vehicle registration are locked behind **\"Moses\"** in Chapter 2.\n3. **The Sinfrontera Heist Tree (Chapter 3)**:\n   - Scoping out the bank (**\"Sinfrontera National Bank\"**) unlocks five modular preparation tasks (retrieving the specialist in *\"Security Expert\"*, blowing cell towers in *\"Hidden Charges\"*, safe-cracking drill in *\"Safe Word\"*), which dictate vault timers and police response times during *\"The Cartel Heist\"*.\n4. **The Airport Heist Tree (Chapter 4)**:\n   - Progression is gated by a $75,000 wire to Abe in *\"Party Hard\"*, leading up through Dre'Quan's arc in *\"Headliners\"* and the prep work in *\"Fully Catered\"* into the **\"VCIA Takedown\"**.\n5. **Irreversible Points of No Return**:\n   - **\"Sunset\"** (Chapter 4) permanently seals open-world pacing leading into Chapter 5.\n   - **\"Protective Custody\"** (Chapter 5) presents an explicit **\"Proceed vs. Postpone\"** prompt, initiating the continuous 60-minute finale gauntlet (**\"The End of the Road\"**).","thinking":"The mission flow chart artifact has been successfully generated. The user needs to be pointed to the artifact and any outstanding questions must be highlighted.\n\n\n"}
